# The Today view lists blocks due or started today or earlier, and leaves out future, undated and invalid dates.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office @due({today})
	- Bank @due({today-3})
	- Pharmacy @start({today-1})
	- Gym @start({today})
	- Dentist @due({today+1})
	- Groceries
	- Someday @due(soon)
	- Bad day @due(2026-02-30)
END
see Errands:
keys gt
see Today
see - Post office  Errands
see - Bank  Errands
see - Pharmacy  Errands
see - Gym  Errands
hide Dentist
hide Groceries
hide Someday
hide Bad day
